  "seat": "**The seat.** An individual who is, or is about to become, a director, the company secretary or a member (shareholder) of a company incorporated under the Act, or of a foreign company registered under it, or who deals with one, asking on facts they can state what the Act requires or lets them do, what rights they have against the company or its directors, what they must disclose, file, approve or vote on and by when, and what follows if it is not done. (Assumed, not ruled: the Act is addressed to companies, so the individual is whoever stands in a company's management or ownership. There is ne",
